Cell["\<\
A polyline through the centre of a 5 \[Times] 5 grid: 36 members, each 8 \
edges long, and 12 of them \[LongDash] the six geodesics in, times the six \
out, counted once per piece \[LongDash] pass the centre.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"4ced344c-ff62-47cb-b74b-5a1f3ecdacce"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

